            'dsb 2026/06/08 Moved this code to ifsPOP1FirstYear to ensure it is available for use in ifsPOP1FirstYear for migration and population growth calculations
            'jrs 2014/09/04 *** begin *** 
            'Dim IRGDPR() As Single
