                '       First Year:  Back-calculate Mean of Consumption for Log Normal $5.5 ($2011)
                '       --------------------------------------------------------------------------
                'mti 2021/06/30
PovRatInit(INCOMELT550LN(R%), POP(R%), GINIDOM(R%), C(R%), PPPCONV(R%), 5.5, POVGAP55(R%), PovGap55Shift(R%), NSNARAT55(R%), "NSNARAT55", 1.9, NSNARAT19(R%), "NSNARAT19", bNoPoor19, GRPS(1, R%), context)
