                'ICTCYBSECSPEND(R%) = Amin(0.1, AMAX(0.001, (INFRAINDICT(R%) / 83.33) * GDPPCP(R%) / 500)) '83.33 is the max of InfraindICT

                'ICTCyberSecSpendExp = Amin(0.4, (Log(Amin(10, ICTINDEX(R%))) / 3.65) * (Log(Amin(80, GDPPCP(R%))) / 6.95))
                'avoiding negatives
                ICTCyberSecSpendExp = CSng(Amin(0.4, (Log(AMAX(1.01, Amin(10, ICTINDEX(R%)))) / 3.65) * (Log(Amin(80000, GDPPCP(R%) * 1000)) / 17.805)))
                '  Debug.Print IY; RegName(R%)
                ICTCYBSECSPEND(R%) = ICTCyberSecSpendExp * ictcybsecspendm(R%)
                'If RegName(R%) = "Somalia" And IY > 15 And ICTCYBSECSPEND(R%) <= 0 Then Stop

