                Else
                    'XWORKREMITOUT(R%) = CSng(POPFOREIGNIN(R%) * RemitPerWorkerOut(R%) * GDPPC(R%) * xworkremitoutm(R%) * AMAX(0.05, (1 - IY% * 0.01)))
                    'bbh 2024/03/24 replaced 0.01 above with 0.001 below
