                '        Par1 = elerca1
                '        Par2 = elerca2
                'Par1 = elerca1 * 0.2
                'Par2 = elerca2 * 0.2

                'bbh 2021/09/09 Start: Cut these substantially and dampened exchange rates and current account, also C and Poverty swings
