                '        EXRATE(R%) = EXRATE(R%) * Mul * Mul2 'bbh 2022/12/20 end PID controller  for Current Account balance
                EXRATE(R%) = CSng(AMAX(0.7 * SExRate(R%), Amin(1.3 * SExRate(R%), EXRATE(R%))))
