                    GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Unskilled) = GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Unskilled) * 0.37! * GDP(R) / SumWel
                    GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Skilled) = GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Skilled) * 0.37! * GDP(R) / SumWel
                    'bbh 2019/07/20 end
                    'mti 2018/07/23 End
                    'GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Unskilled) = GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Unskilled) * 0.2 * GDP(R) / SumWel
                    'GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Skilled) = GOVHHTRNWEL(R%, Skilled) * 0.2 * GDP(R) / SumWel
