                '    hhdispinc(R%, Skilled) = AMAX(0.8 * hhdispinc(R%, Skilled), hhdispinc(R%, Skilled) + XWORKREMIT(R%) * (1 - ShrUnskilledPop))
                'bbh 2021/05/15 end
                'Note:  the bounding of reduction in HHDISPINC by remittances to 20% can throw off SAVINGS-I=CURACT balance; should really not be above 20%
                'mti 2019/03/08 End

                'mti 2016/10/20 Start
                ''   All But First 3: Disposable Income: Household and Firm
                ''   ---------------------------------------------------

ComputeDispInc(R%, ShrUnskilledPop)
