                        (1.0! + xshift(R%, S%)) 'jrs 2016/11/18 added Sector to xshift
                            'bbh 2024/10/21 testing smoothed gross production contribution with formulation below replacing that above
                            '    xbase = CSng((sxkav(R%, S%) * (0.5 * ZS(R%, S%) + 0.5 * szs(R%, S%))) +
