                        xprclag(R%, S%) = CSng(0.4 * (spri(R%, S%) * EXRATE(R%) - WP(S%)) +
                                            0.6 * xprclag(R%, S%))
                        'xprclag(R%, S%) = Diff1 'bbh 2022/12/20 Changed 2nd order term to be normal PID approach

