                    ' ST(R%, S%) = SST(R%, S%) 'bbh 2020/08/21 Pass through above stocks to excess stocks; but then readjust here to take into account reductions
                Next S%


                '        For S% = 1 To NSec% 'To gradually bring prices back to base 1
