                PovGndDiffRefAG = POVRATE(R%, RefAGGnd, Female) - POVRATE(R%, RefAGGnd, Male)

                'Compute percentage change in reference group gender difference
                'mti 2021/07/15 start
                If iPovGndDiffAG(R%, RefAGGnd) <> 0 And Abs(iPovGndDiffAG(R%, RefAGGnd)) > 0.9 Then 'changed .2 to .9
