                '---------------------------------------------------------------------

                'use regression model done by Yutang to forecast gender difference in poverty in reference group (=25-34)
                'PovGndDiffRef = 2.1391 - .9123 * LabWageSexRatio  -0.6947 * EdTerEnrollGross%FtoM + 0.0583 * 100 * INCOMELT685LN(R%) / POP(R%) -0.5863* GEM
                'Gender difference in percentage points = Female Poverty Rate for the age group - Male poverty rate for the age group
                'Setting the co-eff of national poverty rate to zero per BBH and DKB, thus making the whole regression relationship questionable

