                'mti 2021/01/29 Take entire procedure
    
                'mti 2020/04/17 New procedure
                'mti 2020/03/11 - Take entire procedure (mti took off detail marking (that is required for ppc modules only per JRS, I have saved copy anyway, just in case)
    
                Dim j%, R%
                Dim PerPoorShortFall As Single
    
    
    
                For R% = 1 To NR%
    
                    If INCOMELT685LN(R%) > 0 Then
                        'mti 2021/06/30 start
                        'PerPoorShortFall = 365 * 6.85 * (POVGAP(R%) / 100) * POP(R%) / INCOMELT685LN(R%) / 1000  'in thoUSAnd dollars
