            '     -------------------------

            For R% = 1 To NR%
                'bbh 2022/09/05 Subtracted XWORKREMIT from FORSAVRPA and FORSAV; had been commented out but should be in computation
                FORSAVRPA(R%) = MRPA(R%) - XRPA(R%) - AID(R%) - XWORKREMIT(R%)   'Price adjusted compatible with XDEBTRPA
