                SAVINGSRPA(R%) = HHSAV(R%, Unskilled) + HHSAV(R%, Skilled) + FIRMSAV(R%) + GOVBAL(R%) + FORSAVRPA(R%)
                '            If RegName$(R%) = "Ethiopia" Then Stop
